      "widgets_values": [
        "# MOSS-Image text to image (SFT)\n\nFlat version of Comfy-Org's MOSS-Image: Text to Image template with the prompt enhancer and skip-layer guidance removed (AI Chat writes the full caption itself; the template ships SLG switched off).\n\n## Models (Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image)\n\n- diffusion_models: [moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors)\n- text_encoders: [qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors)\n- vae: [flux2-vae_small.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors)\n\nNeeds ComfyUI 0.42.0+. Template sampler: 25 steps, cfg 2.5, er_sde / simple (model shift 5 is built in). Official pipeline: 50 steps, cfg 3.\n\nRecommended 1-2 MP output, sides multiples of 16. Prompts up to ~4K tokens; quote rendered text exactly.\n"
      ]
    }
